                        <ul class="footer-links">
                            <li><a href="/pages/bulk-buy#who-its-for">Who It&rsquo;s For</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/pages/bulk-buy#signature">The Professional Range</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/pages/bulk-buy#order-sizes">Order Sizes</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/pages/bulk-buy#how-it-works">How It Works</a></li>
